flowchart TD
    Start([User Query: shock]) --> SafetyCheck{Safety Check}
    
    SafetyCheck -->|Emergency| EmergencyResp[🚨 Emergency Response<br/>Call 911 + Guidelines]
    SafetyCheck -->|Unsafe| BlockResp[🚫 Blocked Response<br/>Safety Message]
    SafetyCheck -->|Safe| AutoEnhance{Auto-Enhance<br/>Enabled?}
    
    AutoEnhance -->|Yes| PatternMatch[Pattern Matching<br/>15+ Medical Patterns<br/>sepsis, shock, labs...]
    AutoEnhance -->|No| OriginalQuery[Use Original Query]
    
    PatternMatch --> EnhancedPrompt[Enhanced Prompt<br/>Structured Context:<br/>symptoms, vitals, labs, timeline]
    PatternMatch --> SearchQuery[Original Query<br/>For Search APIs]
    OriginalQuery --> SearchQuery
    
    EnhancedPrompt --> LangChainInput[LangChain Processing]
    SearchQuery --> Tier1
    
    subgraph LangChain[LangChain Components]
        LCMemory[ConversationSummaryMemory<br/>or Windowed last 5 turns<br/>+ PII Redaction]
        LCPrompt[PromptTemplate<br/>Medical Q&A Format<br/>Context-aware]
        LCChain[LLMChain<br/>Vendor-agnostic<br/>Groq/OpenAI/Bedrock]
        LCOutput[OutputParser<br/>Extract citations & format]
    end
    
    subgraph RetrievalTiers[4-Tier Hybrid Retrieval]
        Tier1[Tier 1: CAG Cache<br/>Static Knowledge<br/>Priority: 4]
        Tier2[Tier 2: Qdrant<br/>BioBERT Embeddings<br/>Priority: 3]
        Tier3[Tier 3: PubMed<br/>NCBI E-utilities API<br/>Priority: 2]
        Tier4[Tier 4: Academic Search<br/>Semantic Scholar API<br/>Priority: 1]
    end
    
    Tier1 --> Results1[CAG Results<br/>Guidelines & Protocols]
    Tier2 --> Results2[Qdrant Results<br/>Semantic Search]
    Tier3 --> Results3[PubMed Results<br/>2-3 papers + PMID]
    Tier4 --> Results4[Academic Results<br/>1-2 papers filtered]
    
    Results1 --> Aggregate[Aggregate & Rank<br/>Deduplication<br/>Tier-based Scoring]
    Results2 --> Aggregate
    Results3 --> Aggregate
    Results4 --> Aggregate
    
    Aggregate --> TopK[Select Top-3<br/>Truncate to 1000 chars each]
    
    TopK --> TokenCheck{Token Budget<br/>Model Context<br/>Aware}
    TokenCheck -->|Exceeds| ReduceK[Reduce to Top-2<br/>Re-check tokens]
    TokenCheck -->|Within| BuildContext[Build Context Prompt<br/>System + User + Sources]
    ReduceK --> BuildContext
    
    BuildContext --> LangChainInput
    
    LangChainInput --> LCMemory
    LCMemory --> LCPrompt
    LCPrompt --> LCChain
    LCChain --> LLM[Groq API<br/>llama-3.3-70b-versatile<br/>Provider swappable<br/>Temp: 0.3]
    
    LLM --> LCOutput
    LCOutput --> GenerateAnswer[Generate Answer<br/>with citations refs]
    
    GenerateAnswer --> ExtractCitations[Extract Citations<br/>PMID + URLs + Titles]
    
    ExtractCitations --> AddDisclaimer[Privacy Notice<br/>+ Medical Disclaimer<br/>PII Redaction]
    
    AddDisclaimer --> PostSafety{Post Safety<br/>Check}
    PostSafety -->|Issues| FixResponse[Add Missing Disclaimer<br/>Or 911 Reference]
    PostSafety -->|Pass| Display
    FixResponse --> Display
    
    Display[Display Response<br/>+ Sources Expander<br/>+ Chat History<br/>Clickable PMID Links]
    
    EmergencyResp --> Display
    BlockResp --> Display
    
    Display --> End([End])
    
